# Version control and local configuration
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*

# Python environments, caches, builds, and test output
.venv
venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.eggs
build
dist
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage*
htmlcov

# Development-only files and runtime output
# tests/ and scripts/ ARE needed in the build context: they are inputs to the
# QUALITY_RECEIPT.json tree digest, which the "quality-receipt" Dockerfile stage
# recomputes. That stage is the only place they land; neither reaches the runtime
# image, which copies just the verified receipt out of it.
#
# NEVER exclude a digest input. The full set is src/, tests/, scripts/, alembic/,
# db/, pyproject.toml, uv.lock, mypy.ini, ruff.toml and alembic.ini (see
# scripts/quality_receipt.py). Excluding one here does not fail loudly: the gate
# stage recomputes a digest over fewer files and reports "the tree does not match
# its receipt", which reads like a stale receipt and is not one.
*.log
logs
*.pid
.cache
.agri-local-runs
tmp
docker-compose.yml
Makefile
